#: inc/starter-content.php:32
msgid "Check the status of your booking, see your driver once assigned, pay an online deposit, or ask us to change or cancel a trip."
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:36
msgid "Every vehicle is fitted for wheelchair passengers, with restraints for your chair and a seatbelt for you. Tell us about your chair when booking and we will send the right vehicle."
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:40
msgid "Answers to the questions passengers and carers ask us most. Can’t find what you need? Give us a call."
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:44
msgid "We provide regular, reliable wheelchair accessible transport for NDIS participants, aged-care residents and the people who support them — day programs, therapy, work, appointments and social outings."
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:44
msgid "For plan managers, coordinators and providers"
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:44
msgid "You can book on a participant’s behalf and choose to be invoiced. Add the NDIS number or your purchase order to each booking and we will include it on the invoice."
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:44
msgid "Common questions"
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:57
msgid "Sign in to see all your trips, rebook in one tap, save passengers and addresses, and download receipts. NDIS coordinators, aged-care homes and hospitals can open an organisation account to book for their clients."
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:125
msgid "Wheelchair taxi to Frankston Hospital: what to expect"
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:125
msgid "Local guides"
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:126
msgid "Travelling to Melbourne Airport with a power wheelchair: step by step"
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:126
#: inc/starter-content.php:127
msgid "Travel tips"
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:127
msgid "Your first wheelchair taxi trip: what happens on the day"
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:137
#: inc/starter-content.php:138
#: inc/starter-content.php:139
#: inc/starter-content.php:140
msgid "Wheelchairs & accessibility"
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:137
msgid "What size and weight of wheelchair can you carry?"
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:137
msgid "Our vehicles take most standard manual and power wheelchairs and many mobility scooters. If your chair is especially wide, long, tall or heavy, tell us its measurements and weight (with you seated) when you book, so we can confirm the right vehicle before the day."
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:138
msgid "How is my wheelchair secured?"
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:138
msgid "Your chair is secured to the floor with restraints at the front and back, and you wear a lap-sash seatbelt anchored to the vehicle. Power chairs should be switched off with the brakes on. Our drivers are trained to load and secure chairs safely — let them know if your chair has any special tie-down points."
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:139
msgid "Do I have to stay in my wheelchair?"
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:139
msgid "No. You can travel seated in your wheelchair, or transfer to a vehicle seat if you are able to and prefer to. Tell us your preference when booking."
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:140
msgid "Will the driver help me to the door?"
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:140
msgid "Yes. Our service is door-to-door. Add any extra help you need — for example assistance from your front door, or into a hospital reception — in the booking notes."
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:141
msgid "How far ahead should I book?"
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: phone
#: inc/starter-content.php:141
#, php-format
msgid "Wheelchair taxis are in high demand, so booking a day or more ahead is best — especially for early-morning, airport and hospital trips. For a same-day or urgent trip, call us on %s."
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: phone
#: inc/starter-content.php:142
msgid "Can I book the same trip every week?"
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: phone
#: inc/starter-content.php:142
msgid "Yes. When booking online, tick \"This is a regular trip\", choose the days and an end date. Each trip gets its own reference, so you can change or cancel one without affecting the rest."
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:143
msgid "How do I change or cancel a booking?"
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: phone
#: inc/starter-content.php:143
#, php-format
msgid "Use the \"Manage My Booking\" page with your reference and mobile number, or the link in your confirmation email or SMS. For changes within the next two hours, please call %s."
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: phone
#: inc/starter-content.php:144
msgid "Can a carer or family member travel with me?"
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: phone
#: inc/starter-content.php:144
msgid "Yes, carers and family are welcome. Include everyone in the passenger count when you book so we send a vehicle with enough seats."
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:145
msgid "Can I bring my assistance dog?"
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:145
msgid "Yes. Assistance animals are always welcome. If you are travelling with a pet that is not an assistance animal, please mention it in the booking notes so we can check first."
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:146
#: inc/starter-content.php:147
#: inc/starter-content.php:148
msgid "Payments & NDIS"
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:146
msgid "How can I pay?"
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:146
msgid "You can pay the driver at the end of the trip, choose \"Account / invoice\" if you are booking for an NDIS participant, aged-care resident or business, or pay a deposit online when that option is shown on the booking form."
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:147
msgid "Do you accept the Multi Purpose Taxi Program (MPTP)?"
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:147
msgid "Tick the MPTP box when booking and bring your MPTP card. The subsidy is applied to eligible fares in line with the program’s rules."
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:148
msgid "Can you invoice NDIS plan managers?"
msgstr ""

#: inc/starter-content.php:148
msgid "Choose \"Account / invoice\" when booking and enter the plan manager or organisation and their email address, plus the participant’s NDIS number or a purchase order if you have one."
msgstr ""

